From: ReArc Authors
Subject: [PATCH] P-TAB-001 extension tabs answered in the background (ABI 1.55)

Bridge 0.58.0. Add ReArcExtensionTabRequestRespondInBackground, feature
extension_background_tabs: an active tabs.create or options-page request may
be answered with a tab its window does not show, so an import's bulk install
leaves each new extension's welcome page unselected. Chrome's sync installs
are silent too, but the tabs those extensions open still take the window.
ReArcExtensionTabRequestRespond keeps its active-tab check.

Last rebased: 2026-11-10 onto Chromium 156.0.8078.74 (d331de35ca).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

